    LLM: 'Track the trump Under and 9 closely; those two cards control many contracts.\n\nWhen legal, use talon exchange carefully to convert weak cards into suit control before trick play.\n\nUltimo timing is critical: if opponents can force out your trumps early, last-trick plans collapse.',
